Build Caelestia shell 2.5.0 with Qt 6.9.

* QJsonObject::asKeyValueRange() is new in Qt 6.10, so iterate the object
  explicitly instead.
* Include <ranges> where std::views is used rather than relying on it
  arriving transitively.
* DoubleSpinBox is new in Qt 6.10 and SpinBox is integer-only, so
  StyledSpinBox becomes a SpinBox over the value scaled by 10^decimals, with
  a DoubleValidator and locale-aware textFromValue/valueFromText; StepperRow
  passes real from/to/stepSize/value through and reports the real value.
* RectangularShadow gained per-corner radii in Qt 6.10, so Elevation becomes
  an Item that keeps the upstream properties and, when the corner radii
  differ, composes the shadow from four clipped quadrants each using its own
  corner radius.
* `char` is a reserved word for the Qt 6.9 QML parser, so rename the
  `id: char` in the lock screen input field.

Upstream status: Not submitted.

